Z||000000||HYPTNOTiSE||08-17-2000||05:20 PM||||Shaun hammit mentioned to me that travis said that ed parks said that 3.1 liter engines in trucks came with forged cranks.  I was not aware that any trucks ever came with 3.1 liter engines.  When did GM switch from the 2.8 iron head TBI engine to the 4.3? Was they're any lapse in they're where they put 3.1's in?  Thanks!<BR>What are you're ideas folks?<P>------------------<BR>       Mike LeCompte<BR>86 Fiero GT 3.2L w/ Nitrous<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.tcac.net/~daddyg/hypsig.gif"> ||||reg||1
